<xml version="Mixly 2.0 rc4" board="Arduino ESP32@ESP32 Dev Module"><comment id="m$T=!t]2CST*[s;-,SO)" x="280" y="-2" h="93" w="360">如果需要一直发送数据，最好用计时器模块，不会影响主程序的运行

当然，适当使用计时器，不要过多使用</comment><comment id="C2*O]Xq6Q}TA3Q]-xiBa" x="94" y="330" h="100" w="479">如果提示缺少了自定义模块，去 管理库 → mixly 中下载 “通用MQTT” 库
下载完后重启mixly即可

注：如果显示没有结果就用mixly文件里面的 “一键更新” 更新版本</comment><comment id="t_cLXLiAfI_SOphp602e" x="-589" y="454" h="96" w="284">用户名与密码保持SIoT的样式即可，内网连接已默认此格式

客户端ID不需要填写</comment><comment id="R.*v0HfeBxkp!n$_{*AB" x="93" y="457" h="95" w="542">因为mixly只对自家的物联网平台与巴法云适配较好，但是其他的MQTT平台适配较差
所以需要用延迟函数保持连接

注：本实例思路适配其他MQTT平台连接方式</comment><comment id="*CkY,_W,s_f-VyC3Ss^z" x="-287" y="693" h="40" w="414">延时最佳范围在10ms到400ms，这个区间的体验均相同（大概）</comment><block type="simple_timer" id="7KK^,fr[wx|~)}X1mfb/" x="650" y="-45"><field name="NO">1</field><value name="timein"><shadow type="math_number" id="`Hdo^/-edILu3Bdk=9Y?"><field name="NUM">1000</field></shadow></value><statement name="zxhs"><block type="controls_if" id="=R/[$6z~vQM0EqdAMG1T"><value name="IF0"><block type="logic_compare" id="k:La)/B#!c|iJk}.a150"><field name="OP">GTE</field><value name="A"><block type="variables_get" id="6!hDW?E/jYJ]Miu(NNdW"><field name="VAR">item</field></block></value><value name="B"><block type="math_number" id="V;sIJ=}5i`Wsm!^KWQRk"><field name="NUM">1</field></block></value></block></value><statement name="DO0"><block type="variables_set" id="3:Vq[=xJ/x,3[}PB8}./"><field name="VAR">iii</field><value name="VALUE"><block type="math_random_int" id="JaatLtO(wkb*y)Govetb"><value name="FROM"><shadow type="math_number" id="I^!`Q3(3wwxk;Z|/KdRG"><field name="NUM">1</field></shadow></value><value name="TO"><shadow type="math_number" id="kMTghkH7M]0)=v{V@56="><field name="NUM">100</field></shadow></value></block></value><next><block type="MQTT_publish" id="_B;(qi+7^?v/v`}l-4vw"><value name="data"><shadow type="text" id="lJ/$FEW=3Scd`L+]*xAS"><field name="TEXT">Hello</field></shadow><block type="variables_get" id="_bl.f!/D)[:9noiGfR1A"><field name="VAR">iii</field></block></value><value name="topic"><shadow type="text" id="I7o.f89vv+jX9X5dVJ4r"><field name="TEXT"></field></shadow></value></block></next></block></statement></block></statement></block><block type="base_setup" id="=?p6!ANXmx=G;8DfezA]" x="-290" y="18"><statement name="DO"><block type="variables_declare" id="O3FKy(jd.gHiXPW0XHI["><field name="variables_type">global_variate</field><field name="VAR">item</field><field name="TYPE">int</field><value name="VALUE"><block type="math_number" id="q=8@ccC#My]UeLbLqD@4"><field name="NUM">0</field></block></value><next><block type="WIFI_info" id="y7B8/+AC`Z8F.3F.?y.d"><value name="SSID"><shadow type="text" id="`zHlMSB4s8/qd1XS6R9J"><field name="TEXT"></field></shadow></value><value name="PWD"><shadow type="text" id="/BCe],Pk=F=|bhU2lwxE"><field name="TEXT"></field></shadow></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="q9pBG.-[5FInZR19prdX"><field name="VAR">item</field><value name="VALUE"><block type="math_arithmetic" id="g,YEL0R7aHLdeW9-6PAS"><field name="OP">ADD</field><value name="A"><shadow type="math_number" id="h,L{X}J*Td/QY*$BAEys"><field name="NUM">1</field></shadow><block type="variables_get" id=":==pFB9#CLuu|[k?95;B"><field name="VAR">item</field></block></value><value name="B"><shadow type="math_number" id="kxpZE2G,-JDdx4SxDt;G"><field name="NUM">1</field></shadow></value></block></value><next><block type="inout_digital_write2" id="6)~/0x?boB+x,xVl4MJh"><value name="PIN"><shadow type="pins_digitalWrite" id="Y9D2YfOO|z0*?P`,DJH0"><field name="PIN">2</field></shadow></value><value name="STAT"><shadow type="inout_highlow" id="OhvPHc|qsfrWFr^n#pHf"><field name="BOOL">HIGH</field></shadow></value><next><block type="controls_delay" id="Duy0e}nBmcY0{jGQWdJ5"><field name="UNIT">delay</field><value name="DELAY_TIME"><shadow type="math_number" id="KOK8GRCFV8}6d}ru;sUQ"><field name="NUM">2000</field></shadow></value><next><block type="inout_digital_write2" id="0z}H[23C(j$ij(zzWPJQ"><value name="PIN"><shadow type="pins_digitalWrite" id="_h0O|eqAyy4Vwb)G5V5V"><field name="PIN">2</field></shadow></value><value name="STAT"><shadow type="inout_highlow" id="uc!zx!5cDvHM}o0H(|-f"><field name="BOOL">LOW</field></shadow></value></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></statement></block><block type="MQTT_received_the_news" id="Y^Uxnog6tHp,Bu(LPP^{" x="674" y="250"><comment pinned="true" h="80" w="174">这里会因为初始化连接后会断掉订阅所以要延时函数来保持连接</comment><value name="topic"><shadow type="text" id="~ZclV9DAh;TjsH@_{aQ3"><field name="TEXT">222</fi